# Alhaitham Nahida Fischl Diona. ~25s Rot. Alhiaitham Spread in a spit rotation with C6 Diona providing 200 EM. NO Diona with deepwood Nahida isn't far behind.

# Team
haitham char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
haitham add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
haitham add set="gd" count=4;
haitham add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 dendro%=0.466 cr=0.311; #main
haitham add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.0992 er=0.1102 em=79.28 cr=0.331 cd=0.7944; # HoD
